Source: vortex-core
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Vortex OS <khemchanseenanan@gmail.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: vortex-core
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
 zram-tools,
 systemd-oomd,
 systemd-resolved,
 fail2ban,
 python3-systemd,
 ufw,
 openssh-server,
 procps
Suggests: vortex-core-sdcard
Description: Vortex OS identity, adaptive memory stack and hardening
 The heart of Vortex OS: os-release branding, MOTD, the vortex-tune
 self-sizing memory engine (zram + sysctl + vortex.slice cgroup limits +
 Node heap sizing), systemd-oomd pressure-kill policy, journald caps,
 SSH/fail2ban/ufw/sysctl hardening, and the vortex-slim footprint stripper.

Package: vortex-core-sdcard
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, vortex-core, log2ram
Description: SD-card wear reduction for Vortex OS (Raspberry Pi)
 Pulls in log2ram to keep /var/log in RAM and flush periodically.
 Installed only by the Raspberry Pi image pipeline — do not install on
 SSD/NVMe-backed machines or VMs.
